{"beat": 44, "name": "THE ZONES", "text": "If you ship your own orders, do the same with zones. Where do your parcels actually go? A store whose customers sit mostly in the far zones pays a different card than one whose customers are close. Sears' customers knew their zone because the postmaster told them. You can know yours from your own shipping reports. The carrier's card is public. Your mix of zones is in your own data.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "If", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12}, {"word": "you", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.24}, {"word": "ship", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.5}, {"word": "your", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.66}, {"word": "own", "start": 0.66, "end": 0.84}, {"word": "orders,", "start": 0.84, "end": 1.24}, {"word": "do", "start": 1.42, "end": 1.5}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.5, "end": 1.64}, {"word": "same", "start": 1.64, "end": 1.9}, {"word": "with", "start": 1.9, "end": 2.08}, {"word": "zones.", "start": 2.08, "end": 2.46}, {"word": "Where", "start": 3.2, "end": 3.3}, {"word": "do", "start": 3.3, "end": 3.4}, {"word": "your", "start": 3.4, "end": 3.52}, {"word": "parcels", "start": 3.52, "end": 4.04}, {"word": "actually", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.48}, {"word": "go?", "start": 4.48, "end": 4.82}, {"word": "A", "start": 5.44, "end": 5.54}, {"word": "store", "start": 5.54, "end": 5.86}, {"word": "whose", "start": 5.86, "end": 6.14}, {"word": "customers", "start": 6.14, "end": 6.7}, {"word": "sit", "start": 6.7, "end": 6.98}, {"word": "mostly", "start": 6.98, "end": 7.38}, {"word": "in", "start": 7.38, "end": 7.6}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.6, "end": 7.7}, {"word": "far", "start": 7.7, "end": 7.96}, {"word": "zones", "start": 7.96, "end": 8.52}, {"word": "pays", "start": 8.52, "end": 8.82}, {"word": "a", "start": 8.82, "end": 9.02}, {"word": "different", "start": 9.02, "end": 9.26}, {"word": "card", "start": 9.26, "end": 9.72}, {"word": "than", "start": 9.72, "end": 9.96}, {"word": "one", "start": 9.96, "end": 10.16}, {"word": "whose", "start":